# Description
This PR implemented on the feature of multisite for the Retail React App (Pwa). The starting point will be set inside `pwa-kit-config.json` file.  

## Context
According to 1 pager, we'd like to provide options 1a, and 2 for multisite feature
There are two options developers can choose to set up their multisite. 

- Option 1a: When a developer is standing up a multi-site project, they can configure a single codebase running on a single MRT environment/domain to work with multiple sites configured in Commerce Cloud business manager.
For example:

pwa-kit.mobifystorefront.com/us → RefArch site
pwa-kit.mobifystorefront.com/global → RefArchGlobal site
- Option 2: When a developer is standing up a multi-site project, they can configure a single codebase running on multiple MRT environments/domains to work with multiple sites configured in Commerce Cloud business manager
For example:

us.pwa-kit.mobifystorefront.com → RefArch site
intl.pwa-kit.mobifystorefront.com → RefArchGlobal site

## How does site determination look like in the code
In the PWA, we have a config file `pwa-kit-config.json` file that allows developers to set up their multisite configuration. Based on the config,  the algorithm to look for site will look like this:
- Look for site based on hostname first, if this host/domain only has one site, return it 
- If this host has more than one site, we will use pathname to look for the site that matches the id/alias in the url
- Each domain comes with a defaultSite that we wish to use as a fallback value, if no site can be found from previoys ways, use this default value instead
- Throw error if none is found

## Assumptions
Some assumptions for the algorithm to work:
- Site Alias and site Id have to be unique for each site configuration

## Config file
The multi-site config will now have two sections `sites` and `routing`. 
- The `sites` will be the information that is similar to demanware site including site id, locales, currencies. 
- The `routing` will contain information about `domains`, `siteMaps`, `defaultSite`, `url` config. This information will determine the app behavior in term of routing and navigation.

1. Single site, single locale
```
{
    "app": {
        "sites": {
            "RefArchGlobal": {
                "supportedCurrencies": ["GBP"],
                "defaultLocale": "en-GB",
                "defaultCurrency": "GBP",
                "supportedLocales": [
                    {
                        "id": "en-GB",
                        "preferredCurrency": "GBP"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "routing": {
            "url": {
                "site": "none",
                "locale": "none",
                "showDefault": true
            },
            "hosts": [
                {
                    "domain": ["www.domain-1.com", "localhost"],
                    "defaultSite": "RefArchGlobal",
                    "siteMaps": [
                        {
                            "id": "RefArchGlobal",
                            "alias": "global"
                        }
                    ]
                },
            ]
        }
    }
}
```
2. Option 1A: Multi-site, multi-locale that shows locale and site alias in the url as path or query_param. This will be deployed to one single MRT
```
{
    "app": {
        "sites": {
            "RefArch": {
                "supportedCurrencies": ["USD"],
                "defaultCurrency": "USD",
                "defaultLocale": "en-US",
                "supportedLocales": [
                    {
                        "id": "en-US",
                        "alias": "en",
                        "preferredCurrency": "USD"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "en-CA",
                        "alias": "ca",
                        "preferredCurrency": "USD"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "RefArchGlobal": {
                "supportedCurrencies": ["GBP", "EUR"],
                "defaultLocale": "en-GB",
                "defaultCurrency": "GBP",
                "supportedLocales": [
                    {
                        "id": "de-DE",
                        "preferredCurrency": "EUR"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "en-GB",
                        "preferredCurrency": "GBP"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "routing": {
            "url": {
                "site": "path",
                "locale": "path",
                "showDefault": true
            },
            "hosts": [
                {
                    "domain": ["www.domain-1.com"],
                    "defaultSite": "RefArchGlobal",
                    "siteMaps": [
                        {
                            "id": "RefArch",
                            "alias": "us"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "RefArchGlobal",
                            "alias": "global"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
```
3. Option 2:  Multi-site, multi-locale that does not want to display site info on the url. 
```
{
    "app": {
        "sites": {
            "RefArch": {
                "supportedCurrencies": ["USD"],
                "defaultCurrency": "USD",
                "defaultLocale": "en-US",
                "supportedLocales": [
                    {
                        "id": "en-US",
                        "alias": "en",
                        "preferredCurrency": "USD"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "en-CA",
                        "alias": "ca",
                        "preferredCurrency": "USD"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "RefArchGlobal": {
                "supportedCurrencies": ["GBP", "EUR", "CNY", "JPY"],
                "defaultLocale": "en-GB",
                "defaultCurrency": "GBP",
                "supportedLocales": [
                    {
                        "id": "de-DE",
                        "preferredCurrency": "EUR"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "en-GB",
                        "preferredCurrency": "GBP"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "routing": {
            "url": {
                "site": "none",
                "locale": "path",
                "showDefault": true
            },
            "hosts": [
                {
                    "domain": ["www.domain-1.com"],
                    "defaultSite": "RefArchGlobal",
                    "siteMaps": [
                        {
                            "id": "RefArchGlobal",
                            "alias": "global"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "domain": ["www.domain-2.com"],
                    "defaultSite": "RefArch",
                    "siteMaps": [
                        {
                            "id": "RefArch",
                            "alias": "us"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
```

