## 🎯 This PR...
improves the structure of the data that gets sent back to the frontend. 

## 🔍 Context
Previously, we returned two fields, that contained a hardcoded string 'price @ trader/market'. 
We've decided to change this to a more flexible and robust format that allows the api consumer to decide how to format this data easily.

The data structure has been changed to:
ItemSearchResult.prices: Prices

Prices:
```
{
  trader: TraderPrice;
  market: MarketPrice;
}
```

TraderPrice:
```
{
 name: string;
 price: number;
}
```

MarketPrice:
```
{
 price: number;
}
```

